Z||000011||onfire||03-01-2001||01:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 87GTZ34:<BR><B>Std, If you want to fix your cruise, I have a spare working system. Oh BTW - I don't think I would put the cruise on much past 80 unless I was in the desert or something.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You should see the drive to Spokane. Not much out their but farm land. We had the cruise set at 80 most of the way. The speed limit on I-90 is 70(through most of it).We did kick it up a notch or 2. So we could test the cruise control at higher speeds(yeah that's it just a test officer). We did make it to Spokane in just over 4 hours(normally a 5 hour trip).<BR>||||reg||1
